        "structural_description": "Level 40 PassiveTriggering Zealotry 10 times now transforms your Chastise into Divine Fury. Divine FuryUnleash divine fury, dealing 91 + 45% holy SP + 25% AP Holy damage to an enemy and up to 4 nearby enemies and reduces their armor by -5% for 20 seconds, stacking 5 times."
      },
      {
        "name": "Norgannon's Wrath",
        "claim_ids": [
          "talent:templar/zealot:19-50-2-9"
        ],
        "structural_description": "Target an enemy and leap into the air. After a short delay, you blast them with immense holy force, dealing 1506 + 100% holy SP + 100% AP Holy damage to up to 10 enemies within 5 yds and reduces their damage and healing done by -10% for 5 seconds.Damage dealt pierces all immunities, resistances, and damage absorption effects.Scales with modifiers to Chastise."
      }
    ],
